      "name": "Companion Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Desktop white companion card; mobile transparent item inside a shared white panel.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-contact\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">姐</span><span><strong>姐姐</strong><small>AI 家人</small></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-contact{font-family:var(--font-sans,Urbanist,sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-align:center;width:100%;min-height:230px;padding:24px 20px;border:0;border-radius:24px;background:var(--surface,#FFFDFB);color:var(--ink,#2B241B);cursor:pointer}.ds-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;width:88px;height:88px;border:3px solid var(--surface,#FFFDFB);border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2CFB6,#EBE3F5);color:#57372A;font-size:2.4rem}.ds-contact strong{display:block;font-size:1.2rem}.ds-contact small{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6F6258)}.ds-contact:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface,#FFFDFB) 92%,var(--brand-soft,#F4E3DA))}.ds-contact:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8360B1;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:768px){.ds-contact{background:none;border-radius:0;min-height:130px;padding:0 5px;gap:9px}.ds-avatar{width:70px;height:70px;font-size:2rem}.ds-contact strong{font-size:1rem}.ds-contact small{font-size:.68rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversation Pair",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Sage user message and white assistant, with explicit AI identity.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-conversation\"><p class=\"ds-user\">想聊聊今天。</p><div class=\"ds-assistant\"><span class=\"ds-speaker\" aria-label=\"AI 家伴头像\">伴</span><small>AI 家伴</small><p>我在听，你想先说哪件事？</p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-conversation{font-family:var(--font-sans,Urbanist,sans-serif);display:grid;gap:20px;padding:24px;background:var(--fa-chat,linear-gradient(#F5E4E4,#F0F0EE));color:var(--ink,#2B241B)}.ds-user{justify-self:end;margin:0;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:30px 30px 4px 30px;background:var(--fa-sage,#93AF5B);color:var(--fa-sage-ink,#33451F);font-size:1.1rem}.ds-assistant{position:relative;margin-left:52px;padding:18px 22px 14px;border-radius:30px 30px 30px 4px;background:var(--surface,#FFFDFB);font-size:1.125rem;line-height:1.8}.ds-speaker{position:absolute;left:-52px;top:2px;display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2CFB6,#EBE3F5);color:#57372A}.ds-assistant small{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted,#6F6258)}.ds-assistant p{margin:0}@media(max-width:768px){.ds-assistant{margin-left:0;padding:16px 16px 16px 55px;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75}.ds-speaker{left:12px;top:16px;width:32px;height:32px}.ds-user{font-size:1rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cottage Object Entry",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "cottage-hotspot",
      "description": "Approved ivory pill overlay with semibold sans-serif UI type for a memory object; local to the cottage.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-cottage-object\">记忆书架</button>",
      "css": ".ds-cottage-object{font-family:\"Noto Sans SC Variable\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;padding:8px 16px;min-height:38px;border:1px solid #fff1dc9c;border-radius:25px;background:#f7e5ccf2;color:#51301d;box-shadow:0 3px 14px #3b211a24;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,transform .18s}.ds-cottage-object:hover{background:#fff0d7;transform:translateY(-3px)}.ds-cottage-object:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff5d4;outline-offset:5px;box-shadow:0 0 0 7px #805c3e}.ds-cottage-object:active{transform:none}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-cottage-object{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cottage Save Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "cottage-primary",
      "description": "Brown save action inside the private memory panel.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-cottage-save\">收进小屋</button>",
      "css": ".ds-cottage-save{font-family:\"Noto Sans SC Variable\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:500;min-height:45px;padding:11px 20px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#795333;color:#fffaf2;cursor:pointer}.ds-cottage-save:hover{background:#654328}.ds-cottage-save:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #95633d;outline-offset:3px}.ds-cottage-save:active{background:#654328}.ds-cottage-save:disabled{background:#a89783;opacity:.55;cursor:wait}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cottage Story Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "cottage-field",
      "description": "Labeled sans-serif text entry on warm paper.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-cottage-field\"><span>想留下的话</span><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"今天发生了什么？\"></textarea><small>保存在你自己的小屋，仅当前账号可见。</small></label>",
      "css": ".ds-cottage-field{display:grid;gap:8px;font-family:\"Noto Sans SC Variable\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:#684b36;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.6}.ds-cottage-field textarea{font:400 14px/1.75 \"Noto Sans SC Variable\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;min-height:100px;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid #ddcdb8;border-radius:9px;background:#fffdf8;color:#493326;resize:vertical;caret-color:#8b5833}.ds-cottage-field textarea::placeholder{color:#927b65}.ds-cottage-field textarea:hover{border-color:#cbb18c}.ds-cottage-field textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #95633d;outline-offset:3px}.ds-cottage-field small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#806c57;line-height:1.8}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Familia App 的亲近陪伴",
    "overview": "用户确认的手机端与桌面端整套预览是当前视觉依据：淡紫与桃色柔和铺底，联系人以珊瑚渐变突出人物，白色胶囊承托深棕操作。这里记录已落地的生产界面，不另造视觉概念。样式顺序为基础样式、app/familia.css、最后加载的 app/preview-parity.css；批准图索引见 .impeccable/references/approved-preview/manifest.json。\n\n家庭影像、原声和家庭事实保留真实来源，AI 家人始终标明为个人陪伴设定。用户批准 public/demo/preview 的示意头像、封面和演示合影作为有文字标识的界面回退，真实上传优先；这些资源不能写成真实家庭记忆或模型事实。缺图也可使用姓名首字或 Lucide 人物图标。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "柔和彩色渐变、白色胶囊和深棕操作。",
      "自托管 Urbanist 配合中文 Noto 无衬线，应用字标同用无衬线。",
      "绿色用户气泡与白色助手气泡，身份及来源清楚。",
      "留白、真实状态和可见焦点优先。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Pair Rule",
        "body": "联系人姓名及说明继承 ink；绿色用户气泡使用 fa-sage-ink。不要把浅色文字重新放在这些正文位置。夜间使用暗紫棕画布、浅桃操作与更深的背景渐变；高对比将辅助文字及边界提升至正文色。新组件复用现有语义属性。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Root Scale Rule",
        "body": "延续根字号偏好和 rem 正文。手机聊天输入保留 max(1rem,16px)。页面局部字号不升级为全站固定标题规则。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reduced Motion Rule",
        "body": "减少动态设置下，Familia、创建和心情页面关闭动画、过渡与平滑滚动。普通按钮（.16s）和字段焦点（.15s）保留已有状态反馈，不新增通用入场动效。",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Cottage Scope Rule",
        "body": "小屋的字体、字号、颜色、胶囊与阴影是批准场景的局部规范，优先于其他页面的通用描述。检测器相对旧 Familia 基线报告的 font、font-size、color 与 radius 差异，应按本扩展及 sidecar 的 `extensions.memoryCottage` 核对；不据此把小屋改回 Urbanist、紫桃渐变或聊天气泡，也不把这些局部值推广到全站。CSS 中的纸色明暗、木色文字与阴影透明度变体以对应小屋样式为实现来源。",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 从实际 Familia 实现延续渐变、胶囊、圆头像与棕色操作。",
      "**Do** 保留夜间、高对比、字号和减少动态偏好。",
      "**Do** 保留真实内容来源、AI 身份及操作前积分说明。",
      "**Do** 使用 Lucide 与可访问名称，头像使用获权图片或有意义的首字。",
      "**Do** 在记忆小屋内保留批准的雨窗木质书房、品牌与顶栏衬线、入口及短提示无衬线与象牙胶囊；手机竖屏保留同款图片场景及四件实体物品热点，其他窄屏使用紧凑导航回退。",
      "**Do** 以用户原始照片、录音与文字作为小屋内容，明确显示私人保存与真实处理状态。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 将标识为示意的头像、封面或演示合影写成真实家庭资料，或覆盖真实上传。",
      "**Don't** 把 AI 家人当真实家庭成员，或将影像回看标成实时视频通话。",
      "**Don't** 用浅色文字破坏联系人正文与用户气泡的颜色配对。",
      "**Don't** 将年龄轮、心情弧线或描述柔光推广到所有页面。",
      "**Don't** 将小羊提示写成真实家人回应、自动转写或自动生成故事；不得用示意房间相框编造用户照片。",
      "**Don't** 将小屋内容自动发布到家庭空间，或把小屋的场景规则推广到家庭和陪伴工作区。"
    ]
  }
